 over a hand-rolled WebSocket).\n\n- **It orchestrates the agent \"trio\"** â€” researchPrime (research) â†’ Crucible (planning) â†’ Foreman (build) â€” as durable, server-side terminal sessions. Each session runs in its own **git worktree** for isolation, auto-loads its lane's skill **once** (no repeating-prompt loop), supports a **Claudeâ†”Gemini engine toggle** (Gemini research-only), produces **cached, grounded summaries**, tracks **cost/tokens/time rollups**, and supports stage handoffs and type-aware deliverable launching (skill/tool/service/program/doc).\n\n- **One declared native-dependency exception:** `pywinpty` for the ConPTY terminals (lazy, optional `pip install .[terminal]`, degrades gracefully). Everything else is **Python stdlib only**, enforced by `distro.py`'s import scan. Branded as a **Ghost World Labs** tool \"powered by NextGen Nuclear â˜¢.\"\n\nIn short: **Anchor is a markdown-backed personal task/project dashboard that has grown into a local mission-control for running the researchPrimeâ†’Crucibleâ†’Foreman agent trio on each project.**"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4412,"cache_creation_input_tokens":25254,"cache_read_input_tokens":20597,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":25254},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"aafc844f-ab99-410e-a1e4-757497d40b66","uuid":"5ebd9506-1cb9-4623-96ae-ffccd12d0a98","request_id":"req_011Cc2LNS9bhbkP4u8dEYob7"}
